                    and Miscellaneous.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d204-f2" n="2" xml:id="d204-f2-content">
                <p>On October 12, the President of the General Assembly announced that a mission
                    composed of the Permanent Representatives of Afghanistan, Ceylon, Costa Rica,
                    Dahomey, Morocco, and Nepal and Brazil’s Ambassador to Canada would travel to
                    South Vietnam to investigate relations between the Government of the Republic of
                    Vietnam and the Buddhist community. (Telegram 1338 from USUN, October 13;
                    Department of State, Central Files, SOC 14-1 S VIET-UN)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d204-f3" n="3" xml:id="d204-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 603 to Saigon, October 19. (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid</hi>., SOC 12-1
                    S VIET)</p>
            </note>
